publish	Build and publish both architectures	2026-10-21T08:09:01.2342247Z               "message": "Add public uptime status pages\n\nAdd organization status pages with explicitly selected uptime monitors, compatible list/create routes and a native management UI. Publish a server-rendered status view that exposes only monitor names and availability.\n\nStore stable globally unique slugs, enforce same-organization monitor membership, preserve pages through reopen, and reject private or unknown public slugs. Cover PostgreSQL, HTTP, compatible DTOs, responsive Chromium and public URL-redaction behavior.",
